  "category": "Dry",
  "description": "Sara Lee Butter Bread, 20 oz, White Bread, bag is a delightful addition to any kitchen, offering a soft and fluffy texture perfect for sandwiches and toast. Each slice of this buttery bread brings a touch of warmth to your meal, making it an ideal choice for creating memorable moments around the table. Embrace the taste of tradition without compromising on quality, as it contains no artificial flavors or colors and no high fructose corn syrup. Whether you're crafting a classic sandwich or indulging in a simple piece of toast, this Sara Lee Bread is designed to nourish and connect, celebrating the simple joy of sharing good food with loved ones. EVERYDAY SANDWICHES: Perfect for crafting delicious sandwiches, this soft and fluffy butter bread enhances every bite, making it an ideal choice for busy families needing quick and tasty meals PORTABLE AND CONVENIENT: The 20 oz packaging is designed for easy storage and transport, ensuring you have delicious bread slices ready for lunchboxes, picnics, or snacks on the go without any fuss SOFT, DELICIOUS TEXTURE: Enjoy a consistently soft and inviting texture that makes your sandwiches moist and flavorful. TREAT YOURSELF: Ideal for cozy family breakfasts or weekend brunches, this buttery bread elevates your toast game, providing a comforting and indulgent experience that's hard to resist MESS-FREE SNACKING: Sliced to perfection, this bread makes it easy to create perfectly portioned sandwiches, minimizing mess and ensuring everyone gets just the right amount without waste",
